meta {
  name: planning-member (calendar source, unseen+month confirmed)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/planning/member?unseen=true&month={{month}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  unseen: true
  month: {{month}}
}

headers {
  X-BetaSeries-Key: {{apiKey}}
  X-BetaSeries-Version: 3.0
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: https://api.betaseries.com
  apiKey:
  token:
  month: 2026-08
}

docs {
  VERIFIED (isolated each param separately, then combined):
  - "fields" has NO effect on this endpoint - it always returns the full
    heavy payload (characters, crew, description, releasesSvod, ...)
    regardless of what's requested. Do not use it here (unlike
    /members/infos, where it does work - see members-infos.bru).
  - "unseen=true" strictly excludes every episode where user.seen == true.
  - "month=YYYY-MM" strictly bounds episodes to that calendar month.
  - Combined (unseen=true&month=YYYY-MM), the result is the exact
    intersection of both filters - confirmed by testing all 4 combinations
    (no params / unseen only / month only / both) and comparing counts,
    seen values, and date ranges.
  
  This is the exact request used by Client.fetch_planning(month) in
  custom_components/betaseries/betaseries/client.py.
}
